(text "AN_RK809 V1.1 section 6.5: 1uF at every LDO input group and output.\nUse the exact -5 startup sequence. Reserved outputs remain disabled in firmware." (at 15.24 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8e571bc5-fb72-575c-8b7d-6419e79415c7"))
(text "3.3V outputs have less than 0.4V headroom: LDO5/6 are limited to 200mA (datasheet p22-23).\nInclude dropout in rail limits. LDO6 enables the CPU buck; VCC_RTC shares the highest input rail." (at 15.24 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3ea2b8fc-339c-5cb9-9aac-c79ae07fd79a"))
)
